{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_sora_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sora_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "距離",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sora_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1d9f8b67078bcaf77795bc7d36797337f988063939d62899438ae9871710fd04",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生了什麼！？這些人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些人......整合運動，為什麼要攻擊這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈、哈......這是怎麼回事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......你們在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手，這是我們的社區！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，不想惹麻煩就讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......不能這麼做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有什麼狗屁能不能的，你們知不知道自己過的是已經爛透了的生活——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請住手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個聲音......難道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趕上了......哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請不要對這裡的居民使用暴力，他們是無辜的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好幾處的街道、商鋪都被毀了，現在，甚至是無辜居民生活的公寓......住在這裡的人們，他們以後該怎樣生活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那又怎樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可不是我們關心的事。不閃開，那就先打趴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會退讓的。為別人帶來快樂，鼓勵大家積極地生活......這是我一直想做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，在你們破壞別人的生活的時候......我要保護他們，我能夠保護他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，現在的我也不是一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只會說空話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（口哨聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉啦，空，我們晚來了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可頌，能天使，還有......德克薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說到這個份上，這些人卻還是執迷不悟啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，只能由正義的企鵝物流出場，咚咚咚！啪嗒啪嗒！三兩下地解決掉你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“企鵝物流”？呵，你們想來干預？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事態緊急，來不及報告了。不過，老闆可不會放著搗亂的傢伙不管~這畢竟是我們做生意的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心，他們隨時會做出危險的舉動。我來拖延他們，讓他們停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那由我和能天使來解決這些人。可頌，你護送人群安全疏散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先打通東邊路線......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼......動......動不了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，看招——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳啊......是那個唱歌的傢伙的源石技藝......不能讓她繼續唱，先解決掉她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈、哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些人......停下來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿......想搞偷襲？那我要開超載模式了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁現在，快走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動術師",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_wizard",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想走？沒那麼容易......試試......這個——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動術師",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_wizard",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能......連我的法術也沒辦法釋放出來......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，空的實力還不止於此哦！空，讓我變得再精神些！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空小姐......真的是你？可是，你怎麼可能出現在這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就現在！衝啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們，到底是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快離開這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在沒有時間考慮......快走、跑起來，繼續跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "♪~♪~♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咦？那個人是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受困的龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啊......不行，我現在的樣子，不能讓人看到......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯姐，有近衛局的人快趕到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。能天使，空——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我知道了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁現在撤退啦！拜拜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我應該......不，我一定見到過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在龍門舉辦的第一次見面會上，第一個將信遞給我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從某一封信之後，突然不再參加活動的女孩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會記錯的，第一位粉絲的面孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，為什麼......她會出現在貧民窟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，她手上的源石結晶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......變成了感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_pgbase_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾日後\n企鵝物流辦公室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......睏死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，空你在這裡啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......能天使，可頌。嗯，今天的練習已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。對了，你要不要和我們出門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前兩天幫了近衛局一些小忙，老闆好像收到通知要我們去近衛局領一下“龍門熱心組織”獎狀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去近衛局門口風光地拍張合影，我看之後誰還敢攔我的車~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對吧，能天使姐的車還是該攔下的。嗯，不過有了照片，應該不會有人來查我的營業執照......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的私人生意也該被查一查了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，小買賣，小買賣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空你在做什麼？唔，這是......信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，這是......粉絲寫的信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對哦，之前你剛來的時候，企鵝物流的門口總是堆滿了各種各樣的禮物，信箱裡也塞滿了信件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......你們先走吧，我等德克薩斯一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行啊，那我們先出去了，車鑰匙留給你們。我坐可頌的車~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，一定把能天使姐您安全及時地送到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可別遲到啊~這可是難得的做榮譽市民的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道啦......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......應該就是這個人。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這封信的筆跡和文字風格......我記得很清楚。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那時候......見面會時也在的......我的第一位粉絲......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......你在等我嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？啊，抱歉，德克薩斯，我走神了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......遇到什麼事了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，沒有......不是什麼大事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯......前幾天我們去貧民窟幫助的那些人......都是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還是很在意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道裡面有你的熟人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不確定，只是......大概，見過一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果真的是她，會出現在那裡也只有這個理由了。她原本......不是生活在那裡的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到信了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天上午和近衛局的通知一起送來的，似乎是前幾天被我們救下的人寫的感謝信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為有那幾封感謝信在，我們才會拿到這次龍門頒發的獎狀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你手上的不是那幾封信嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，這是......以前粉絲的信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "粉絲的信？現在翻出來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......沒什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的沒什麼特別的事情啦，德克薩斯。我只不過是一時興起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要和我一起去近衛局嗎，我開車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......德克薩斯，如果，只是如果。成為感染者的龍門市民，他們還有別的生活方式嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能想到的只有兩個答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開龍門，或是去貧民窟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是啊，只能如此，我明明知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我啊......之後，也能自己去送一些快遞嗎？我不想麻煩別人......但是，既然是企鵝物流的一員，我也想要做和大家一樣的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能保護好自己嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我可以做到......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你能向我證明這一點之後，我不會阻攔的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我總是對德克薩斯說謝謝這句話呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcity_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一周後\n龍門 貧民窟某處"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，請問有人在家嗎？您的包裹到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，您在企鵝物流網站上下單的貨物已經送到啦，麻煩簽收一下~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "包裹......放在門口就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔，能麻煩您順便簽一下名嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我不是很方便出門......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？您遇到什麼麻煩需要幫助嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的......我不是很想出來......你，你是普通快遞員吧......我可是......是礦石病感染者啊......會傳染給你的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你們企鵝物流能夠給我下單買東西的機會，但是我會傳染給你的，快走吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生......先生？請冷靜下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們和感染者客戶一直保持著長期穩定的聯繫，礦石病是不會透過簡單的肢體接觸進行傳播的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請您放心，企鵝物流的員工經受過專業的礦石病防護訓練，您不會傷害到我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，如果您需要幫助，我們也可以及時提供服務，我們負責過一些專業醫藥公司的合作項目......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，您還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......真的不怕我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，企鵝物流將竭誠為每一位客戶提供熱情的服務！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還是算了。就放在門口吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，下次能夠拜託你們幫我送信到上城區嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然沒問題啦！企鵝物流同樣具備信件快遞服務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......好吧。我需要告訴一些人我的近況，如果他們願意給我回信的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先生，如果您不介意的話，我可以幫您聯繫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，還是算了。離我遠點就行。我現在腦子還很亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣吧，下次還是麻煩你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不是她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天也沒有遇到......說不定已經離開龍門了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也可能是我看錯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，寄給企鵝物流的感謝信，和曾經作為粉絲寄給我的信件筆跡是一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有使用詳細的地址，也沒有留下名字。只是簡簡單單的一封感謝信。可是我知道，那就是你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我想見到你。至少，能見一面......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會想要見到我嗎？我該......在現在見你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明我有想說的話，希望能直接告訴你。一定要振作起來，一定要充滿希望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明天，明天也來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半個月後\n龍門貧民窟 某一次送貨途中"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問有人在家嗎？您的包裹到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，您在企鵝物流網站上下單的貨物已經送到啦，麻煩簽收一下~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問有人在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咬牙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，客人填的送貨時間是現在啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，真的沒有人在家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（顫抖）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是她的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（應該是這間沒錯啊......不在家嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放在門口之後發送物流資訊確認......好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空下意識地將手放在口袋邊。她緩緩地將信封拿在手上。\n在滿是反覆折疊痕跡的舊信封上，寫著“致空小姐”的標題。\n信封內裝著反覆比對過的信件，和空已經熟記於心的文字。\n那些對她感謝，讓她放心，卻仍透露出懷念的文字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼都找不到，明明之前還在這附近見到過你......你現在真的不住在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是......想見到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房中的人攥緊了手。\n然而，門還是沒有打開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不過，沒關係，總會再遇見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，好了，下一個包裹是送到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......應該，走了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（彎腰）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（撿起包裹）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝你，空小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，那封信也收到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真想再見你一面啊。但是現在的我，我的身體，我的病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我能夠重新面對自己的時候，你一定也會很欣慰吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......一定會再去你的演唱會，走進你的見面會現場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總有一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
